  <div class="article">
    <h3>About the Film</h3>
    <p><strong>The Grid Unplugged</strong> is the debut from Rick Cutter, President of non-profit August Palm Creative. Using California wildfires as a gateway, it investigates the strain on aging power grids worldwide.</p>
    <p>Balancing alarming risks with promising solutions, it's a common-sense pitch for a moon-shot plan to fix our power infrastructure.</p>
    <div class="press-quote">"Starts with electric cars and ends on a failing power grid. Makes a common-sense pitch for a moon-shot plan to fix it." — Geek Vibes Nation</div>
